{'symbol': 'ZBRA', 'date': '2022-12-21 11:30:00', 'title': 'ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES VOTED TOP SOFTWARE VENDOR BY RETAILERS IN 2023 RIS SOFTWARE LEADERBOARD', 'text': 'LINCOLNSHIRE, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ZEBRA TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ZBRA), AN INNOVATOR AT THE FRONT LINE OF BUSINESS WITH SOLUTIONS AND PARTNERS THAT DELIVER A PERFORMANCE EDGE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY WAS VOTED A TOP SOFTWARE VENDOR ACROSS 24 CATEGORIES IN THE RETAIL INFORMATION SYSTEMS (RIS) 2023 SOFTWARE LEADERBOARD. ZEBRA TOPPED THE LIST IN THE DEPARTMENT STORE AND MASS MERCHANT VENDOR LEADERS CATEGORY AND MOVED UP ONE SPOT FROM LAST YEAR TO SIXTH BEST OVERALL IN THE PRESTIGIOUS TOP 20 CATEGORY, MARKING ITS FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IN THE TOP 10.'}